  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0155_d0399b44ea7f.png\"><br>\nArea $=\\int_0^1 x d x+\\int_1^e \\frac{1}{x} d x=\\frac{1}{2}+1=\\frac{3}{2}$"
